 or PLC in Cottle County","/arc-plc/texas/cottle-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids came in under 90% of normal in September to October in 40 of the 75 years since 1951. In 2025, the middle of the grids ran 236% of normal in March to April and 37% in September to October. So far in 2026, June to July sits at 78% on the middle of the grids. Grid 16618 had its driest year in 1956, at 35% of normal.</p>"}
